  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5605.07 Research",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5605.07 Research. For purposes of RSA 260:14, V(a)(4), disclosures to legitimate businesses for research activities or statistical reports as defined in Saf-C 5601.07, shall be made only via electronic media and only if a minimum number of 250 names is requested, unless otherwise approved by the Commissioner.\n\nSource. #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7527, eff EXEMPT, 7-7-01",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5600.html"
